    {
      "id": 483268,
      "primary_message": "Not all protein powders are created equal. If desired, adjust shake consistency by adding more or less liquid per package instructions. This recipe will make about 8 cups of shake. Work in batches to best fit your blender.",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "id": 483269,
      "primary_message": "Place milk, water, protein powder, yogurt, dates, vanilla, and spices in a blender. Blend on high speed for several minutes until smooth.",
      "secondary_message": "24 fl oz (3 cups) whole milk\n½ cup water\n4 servings vanilla whey-based protein powder (containing 20 grams protein/serving)\n1 cup plain Greek yogurt\n½ cup medjool dates, pitted\n1 tsp vanilla extract\n1 tsp cinnamon, ground\n½ tsp cardamom, ground\n¼ tsp cloves, ground\n⅛ tsp salt"
    },
    {
      "id": 483270,
      "primary_message": "To serve, divide shake between glasses, adding ice if desired. Enjoy!",
